U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>；空间载体、截面值与指标集均取于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>，有关范畴和函子集合在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 中处理。</p>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=C_{\\mathbb R}\">\\(P=C_{\\mathbb R}\\)</span> 为实线上连续实值函数层，茎空间及拓扑见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"08a9469876bddf9f\" href=\"?note=08a9469876bddf9f\" title=\"14-df-etale-space-of-germs\">14-df-etale-space-of-germs</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(f,g:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span> 由下式给定。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{germ}\">\\(\\mathrm{germ}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"46dda10bcd4e0ee1\" href=\"?note=46dda10bcd4e0ee1\" title=\"14-df-germs-and-stalks\">14-df-germs-and-stalks</a> 中的精确签名。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"g=\\{(x,0):x\\in\\mathbb R\\},\\qquad f=\\{(x,0):x\\le0\\}\\cup\\{(x,x^2):x&gt;0\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[g=\\{(x,0):x\\in\\mathbb R\\},\\qquad f=\\{(x,0):x\\le0\\}\\cup\\{(x,x^2):x&gt;0\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a=(0,\\mathrm{germ}_{0,\\mathbb R}f),\\qquad b=(0,\\mathrm{germ}_{0,\\mathbb R}g),\\qquad a\\ne b.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a=(0,\\mathrm{germ}_{0,\\mathbb R}f),\\qquad b=(0,\\mathrm{germ}_{0,\\mathbb R}g),\\qquad a\\ne b.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall A,B\\in\\sigma_P\\;\\bigl(a\\in A\\land b\\in B\\Rightarrow A\\cap B\\ne\\varnothing\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall A,B\\in\\sigma_P\\;\\bigl(a\\in A\\land b\\in B\\Rightarrow A\\cap B\\ne\\varnothing\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 的邻域含正点，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g\">\\(f,g\\)</span> 在任何这样的邻域不全等，两个茎不同。含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\">\\(a,b\\)</span> 的开邻域各含一个相应基本茎图；代表与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g\">\\(f,g\\)</span> 在较小邻域上分别相等。取该共同邻域内负点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 附近均为零，所以共同茎点落在两个基本图中。故总空间非 Hausdorff，虽基空间为 Hausdorff 且投影局部同胚。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-ex-continuous-function-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"14008e4af86a6831","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-ex-continuous-function-sheaf]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-etale-space-of-germs","status":"resolved","id":"08a9469876bddf9f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-etale-space-of-germs]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-germs-and-stalks","status":"resolved","id":"46dda10bcd4e0ee1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-germs-and-stalks]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-etale-space-of-germs","status":"resolved","id":"08a9469876bddf9f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"取 $P=C_{\\mathbb R}$ 为实线上连续实值函数层，茎空间及拓扑见 [[14-df-etale-space-of-germs]]。$f,g:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R$ 由下式给定。","embed":false},{"targe